    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are going to write a caption for an instagram reel, the reel shows one or multiple snake agents running autonomously on a grid. i need you to write a short caption. here is some information about the run: \nsnake_colors:  {{ JSON.stringify($('Code in JavaScript').item.json.snake_colors) }},\ngrid_height: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.env_meta_data.height }},\ngrid_width: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.env_meta_data.width }},\nfinal_steps: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.fatal_steps }}\nsnake_ids: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.snake_ids }},\nnumber_of_snakes: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.snake_ids.length }},\nvideo_start_step: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.video_start_step }}\nvideo_end_step: {{ $('Parse run analysis').item.json.video_end_step }}\nentered_separate_area: {{ JSON.stringify($('Parse run analysis').item.json.entered_separate_area) }}\ntail_visible_phases: {{ JSON.stringify($('Parse run analysis').item.json.tail_visible_phases) }}\n\n\"snake_colors\" explains it self, the list is RGB values,  it is the color of the snakes, this is what the viewers will see, so if you refer to some snake dont refer to it by id, refer to it by the name of the body_color, you need to be as precise as you can with the color description, you can use emojies for helping describe the color, if the emoji color matches well with the snakes body color.\n\n\"final_steps\" is the final step for each snake, the step where it dies. also do not refer to any events by step because the viewers has no idea what step is what, instead refer to events by figuring out where in between \"video_start_step\" and \"video_end_step\" the event occured. \nand also dont refer to any events that occured outside of the \"video_start_step\" and \"video_end_step\" range because those will not be included in the reel.\n\n\"entered_separate_area\" is steps where a snake entered an area where it can not see any part of its own body, it means that the snake has to fit its whole body inside that are a to survive.\n\n\"tail_visible_phases\" are the ranges of steps for each snake where it either can see its own tail, meaning it is guaranteed to be able to stay alive, and where it can not see its tail, which does not mean that it is a guaranteed death but it needs to find the right path. but dont mention the tail beeing visible or not, just use the information to understand if something interesting is happening.\n\nwrite a simple caption. you can use emojies\n\nremember the viewers can only see a video of some snakes going around, they dont know anything about steps or snake ids. and finally dont mention anything about what i have said to you, just simply respond with the caption.\n\nyou can add some relevant hashtags targeting programming, python, algorithms, automated agents and such. but dont go crazy, i dont want hashtags that has nothing to do with this \n\ndont mention anything about, that the snake needs to fit or anything, just describe whats happening in a vague way\n\nWhen there is only one snake then you can make the description shorter and less about what happens.\n\n1 snake: max 100 word\n>1 snake: max 250 words",
        "batching": {}
      },
